"Truckers 3 - Conquering America" is a sequel to the trucking simulator, with one significant difference from previous versions: the game world represents real-life locations.

Game features:
- Download the Russian version of Truckers 3 torrent and conquer American highways from Reno to San Francisco, from San Diego to Eureka;
- Gain recognition in the corporate environment, prove that you are the best carrier in all of California;
- Chat with other truckers, take part in small entertaining races;
- Develop your own business in the field of cargo transportation, create the largest corporation, achieve a leading position in this field;
- Drive real licensed vehicles, with a choice of more than thirty different semi-trailers and trucks, including well-known brands such as Sterling, Freightliner, and others;
